== Documented Changes ==
=== Gameplay Changes ===
* The [[Cantripped!]] challenge now only spawns active item cards, item cards can be swapped out when picking up new cards when all card slots are already full
* {{c|Tainted Cain}} now has the same starting stats as {{c|Cain}} (increased damage and reduced range)
* Salvaging {{c|Tainted Cain}}'s active item no longer spawns special drops in [[special room]]s (such as {{r|Secret Room}}s)
* The fire aura granted by {{i|Breath of Life}} + {{c|Judas}}' {{i|Birthright}} no longer destroys projectiles
* Adjusted the active to passive item ratio from {{i|TMTRAINER}} from 1/2 to 1/4
* Glitch items can no longer destroy {{s|Cathedral}} light beams, ending chests and challenge trophies
* Enemies respawned by the {{i|D7}} no longer drop loot when killed if they were champions and no longer grant score in daily runs
* {{e|Great Gideon}}'s {{r|Crawl Space}} no longer appears in the [[Ascent]] (as it crashed the game when entered)
* {{t|Expansion Pack}} can no longer trigger the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}
* Items in the {{i|Death Certificate}} area now spawn as "option" items similarly to items in {{r|Boss Rush}} and {{r|Angel Room}}s - the player is automatically returned to the main floor whenever picking up an item would cause other items in the room to disappear
* Added rubber banding to {{i|Star of Bethlehem}} - it now moves faster off screen when the player is ahead of it along the path to the boss room and slows down if the player is lagging behind
* {{i|Star of Bethlehem}} now moves towards {{e|Mega Satan}}'s room in the {{s|Chest}} and the {{s|Dark Room}} if its door was unlocked
* {{i|Vanishing Twin}} is now shared by both of {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}' forms - this also fixes several bugs that occur when flipping while Vanishing Twin is copying a [[boss]]
* {{i|Spindown Dice}} is now available in [[challenge]]s and [[daily run]]s, items that are tagged to never appear in those modes are considered locked and will be skipped over
* {{i|Bag of Crafting}} is now available in [[challenge]]s and [[daily run]]s, as well as when playing as {{c|Tainted Lost}}
* {{i|Bag of Crafting}} now obeys changes to item availability such as [[challenge]]s, [[daily run]]s and [[Tainted Lost#Item Exclusion|Tainted Lost's adjusted item pools]] and will not craft items that cannot be normally obtained
* {{i|Death Certificate}} now ignores changes to item availability caused by items or characters (i.e. Tainted Lost or {{i|Sacred Orb}}) and will only refrain from spawning items locked behind [[achievement]]s or current game rules (challenges or daily runs)
* Added new co-op babies
* Updated some of {{c|Eden}}'s hair styles
* Updated a few item qualities
* Updated localization files

