* Fixed the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} removing {{C|Eden}}/{{C|Tainted Eden}} starting items if used immediately in the first room of the first floor. Instead, it will send the player to {{S|Home}}.
* Removed the "loadfile" global function, which was used in various mods. Presumably, this was due to security concerns.

